## Create an Environment

\`\`\`typescript
const environment = await client.beta.environments.create(
  {
    name: "my-dev-env",
    config: {
      type: "cloud",
      networking: { type: "limited", allow_package_managers: true, allow_mcp_servers: true },
    },
  },
